<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's actual 100,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded $0.50 lower than mid-session Thursday. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
